      "tr": "Tek bir `rng` nesnesi; çekiliş sırası sonucu belirler.",
      "en": "A single `rng` object; the order of draws decides the result."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`True - False` Python'da 1; mantıksal değerler doğrudan çıkarılabilir.",
      "en": "`True - False` is 1 in Python; booleans can be subtracted directly."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport random\n\n\ndef bootstrap(ok1, ok2, rounds, seed):\n    n = len(ok1)\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    diffs = []\n    for _ in range(rounds):\n        picks = [rng.randrange(n) for _ in range(n)]\n        diffs.append(sum(ok2[i] - ok1[i] for i in picks) / n)\n    diffs.sort()\n    low, high = diffs[rounds // 20], diffs[rounds - rounds // 20 - 1]\n    return [round((sum(ok2) - sum(ok1)) / n, 3), round(low, 3), round(high, 3)]\n\n\nOK1 = [True] * 31 + [False] * 9\nOK2 = [True] * 29 + [False, False] + [True] * 7 + [False, False]\nprint(bootstrap(OK1, OK2, 2000, 0))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport random\n\n\ndef bootstrap(ok1, ok2, rounds, seed):\n    n = len(ok1)\n    rng = random.Random(seed)\n    diffs = []\n    for _ in range(rounds):\n        picks = [rng.randrange(n) for _ in range(n)]\n        diffs.append(sum(ok2[i] - ok1[i] for i in picks) / n)\n    diffs.sort()\n    low, high = diffs[rounds // 20], diffs[rounds - rounds // 20 - 1]\n    return [round((sum(ok2) - sum(ok1)) / n, 3), round(low, 3), round(high, 3)]\n\n\nOK1 = [True] * 31 + [False] * 9\nOK2 = [True] * 29 + [False, False] + [True] * 7 + [False, False]\nprint(bootstrap(OK1, OK2, 2000, 0))\n```"
    }
